[0] Assumption challenge
  Alternate vertex sets considered: runners, gaps, residual fibers, old hypothesis files, sidecars,
  proof obligations, capacitor pairs, Haar exits, denominator layers, cover arcs, Fourier modes, matroid
  cocircuits, and wall-crossing events.
  Chosen vertices: hidden connector lemmas/proof obligations.  This preserves the LRC predicate of
  boundary/open status plus theorem-route schedulability and tells which older proof object can
  discharge which new residual obligation.
  Destroyed by the quotient: row identity, raw runner names, exact times, and sometimes route labels.
  Retained: status, exit class, sidecar field, and the proof obligation.

